 "You use <span class=\"italic\"> what</span> to ask questions about things. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\"> where</span> to ask questions about places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You ask Wh-questions with the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> or with other verbs. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use <span class=\"strong\">do</span> or<span class=\"strong\"> does</span> with other verbs."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"05\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Answer </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What do you do?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm a secretary. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What's your name?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"My name's Peter.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where do you work?<br />Where do you study?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I work at a big company.<br /> I am a student at Kingston College.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where's your boss?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's in his office.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "And and Or"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use <span class=\"strong\">and </span> to join words, phrases or sentences. <br />Use <span class=\"strong\">or</span> to choose between things or ideas."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">AND </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nouns  (people, places or things)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Peter and Sally are friends. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"phrases (a small group of words)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> on the table and under the chairs </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sentences\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I go to school in the morning, and I work in the afternoon. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">OR </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nouns (people, places or things)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you want tea or coffee? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"phrases (a small group of words)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">in the afternoon or evening </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sentences\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You can go to school, or you can get a job. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "work "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "things or activities that are part of your job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "